This one is from Joe in Birmingham, UK.
这封来自英国伯明翰的乔。

01:00:24.059 --> 01:00:26.920
She says, our whole wedding was himium themes.
她说，我们的整个婚礼都是《老爸老妈浪漫史》的主题。

01:00:26.920 --> 01:00:29.360
Josh, we hear this a lot too, don't we, like the tattoos?
乔什，我们经常听到这种事，对吧，就像纹身一样？

01:00:29.360 --> 01:00:31.320
We hear this, we've heard this so many times.
我们听过太多次了。

01:00:31.320 --> 01:00:32.280
It's amazing.
太惊人了。

01:00:32.280 --> 01:00:34.239
Okay, back to the letter.
好了，回到信上。

01:00:34.239 --> 01:00:40.639
We had a blue French horn is the main table centerpiece and blue violins and red roses on the other tables to represent the blue quartet.
我们用蓝色圆号作为主桌的中心装饰，其他桌上则摆着蓝色小提琴和红玫瑰，以呼应蓝色乐队。

01:00:40.639 --> 01:00:41.840
All the men were ducky ties.
所有男士都系着鸭子领带。

01:00:41.840 --> 01:00:45.599
Our first dance was groups in the heart that Barney and Robin did.
我们的第一支舞跳的是巴尼和罗宾在《奉献之爱》里的舞蹈。

01:00:45.599 --> 01:00:48.000
I had a yellow umbrella for photos, the bride.
拍照时我拿了一把黄雨伞，我是指新娘。

01:00:48.000 --> 01:00:51.159
For our honeymoon, we went to New York and went to McLaren's bar.
我们的蜜月去了纽约，还去了麦克拉伦酒吧。

01:00:52.440 --> 01:00:58.440
The bar that McLaren's is based on, called, but I think she means, which is McGee's in Midtown, shout out to McGee's.
也就是麦克拉伦酒吧的原型，不过我想她的意思是位于中城区的麦吉酒吧，向麦吉酒吧致敬。

01:00:58.440 --> 01:01:00.119
We had a far-hampton sign too.
我们还有一个“法汉普顿”的标牌。

01:01:00.119 --> 01:01:06.199
The guest list was made to look like a playbook and the table plan was designed like a blueprint by most BS designs.
宾客名单被做成了“咸猪手手册”的样子，桌位图则是让莫斯比设计公司设计成蓝图的样式。

01:01:06.199 --> 01:01:09.679
Our son, who was born nine months after our wedding, is called Ted.
我们的儿子在婚礼后九个月出生，名叫泰德。

01:01:09.679 --> 01:01:18.679
On Ted's first birthday, he had bro code t-shirts for him and his brother, and they have a made-up day called Brothers Day, where they hang out together and get each other presents to appreciate each other.
在泰德一周岁生日时，他和哥哥穿了“兄弟法典”T恤，他们甚至还有一个自创的节日叫“兄弟日”，那天他们会一起玩，送彼此礼物来表达感激。

01:01:18.679 --> 01:01:23.760
It's on the Sunday before Valentine's Day because Hashtag grows before hose.
时间就在情人节前的那个星期天，因为口号是“兄弟大过女人”。

01:01:23.760 --> 01:01:30.000
See, you're teaching your son some really good lessons that he shouldn't show up.
你看，你正在教导你儿子一些非常棒的人生哲理，告诉他可别重色轻友。

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:30.840
I don't know.
我不知道。

01:01:30.840 --> 01:01:32.880
That story is beautiful.
这个故事太美好了。

01:01:32.880 --> 01:01:33.719
Amazing, thank you.
太棒了，谢谢你。

01:01:33.719 --> 01:01:35.760
Ted was born nine months after the wedding.
泰德是在婚礼后九个月出生的。

01:01:35.760 --> 01:01:37.039
That was a hell of a wedding night.
那还真是个火辣的洞房花烛夜啊。

01:01:37.039 --> 01:01:37.880
To one hell of a wedding.
致一场无与伦比的婚礼。

01:01:37.880 --> 01:01:38.880
To one hell of a wedding.
致一场无与伦比的婚礼。

01:01:38.880 --> 01:01:40.599
What a wedding.
真是场绝妙的婚礼。

01:01:40.599 --> 01:01:50.480
That is an honor that you guys made your wedding himium seemed and the granularity, the number of good ideas and ways you integrated it, really impressive.
你们能把婚礼办成《老爸老妈浪漫史》的主题，这真是我们的荣幸，而且这种细致程度、那么多绝妙的点子以及融入的方式，真的让人印象深刻。

01:01:50.480 --> 01:01:59.760
And if you're watching this on YouTube or want to check out our sub stack page, yes, we're going to share right now the far-hampton sign from Joe's wedding.
如果你正在YouTube上收看，或者想去我们的Substack页面看看，没错，我们现在就要分享乔婚礼上的“法汉普顿”标牌了。

01:01:59.760 --> 01:02:01.679
Oh, these are pictures from the wedding.
哦，这些是婚礼的照片。

01:02:01.679 --> 01:02:02.760
We have pictures from the wedding.
我们有婚礼的照片。

01:02:02.760 --> 01:02:03.800
There's the Blue French horn.
看，那是蓝色圆号。

01:02:03.800 --> 01:02:04.639
Oh, that's great.
哦，太棒了。

01:02:04.639 --> 01:02:09.159
Blue French horn is the guest book, guest book, and there's little.
蓝色圆号是签名簿，用来做签名簿的，还有一些小玩意。

01:02:09.159 --> 01:02:12.920
There's Ted, they named their son Ted nine months after the wedding.
那是泰德，他们在婚礼后九个月生下了儿子，并给他取名叫泰德。

01:02:12.920 --> 01:02:13.920
It's what?
什么？

01:02:13.920 --> 01:02:14.920
What in Josh?
乔什，这是怎么回事？

01:02:14.920 --> 01:02:15.920
Can you believe that?
你能相信吗？

01:02:15.920 --> 01:02:22.360
Did 2005 you think there was going to be a baby named Ted that people are having weddings and like, you know, there's a lot of dogs named Mosby.
2005年的你会不会想到，以后会有人给孩子起名叫泰德，大家会办这种主题婚礼，而且，你知道的，有很多狗狗都叫莫斯比。

01:02:22.360 --> 01:02:25.840
Let's be a good name for a dog.
这名字挺适合狗狗的。

01:02:25.840 --> 01:02:26.840
Very loyal.
非常忠诚。

01:02:26.840 --> 01:02:28.639
That's some shares and trades with Ted.
这和泰德有一些共同点。

01:02:28.639 --> 01:02:32.050
This is from Chelsea and Durham, North Carolina.
这封来自北卡罗来纳州达勒姆的切尔西。

01:02:32.050 --> 01:02:34.650
I'll try to keep this short just like Ted did.
我尽量长话短说，就像泰德那样。

01:02:34.650 --> 01:02:35.650
That's it.
就这样。

01:02:35.650 --> 01:02:39.210
I bet my wife at summer camp when we were 15.
我和我妻子15岁时在夏令营认识。

01:02:39.210 --> 01:02:44.250
She came out our senior year of high school and then we both went to the same college.
我们在高中毕业那年出柜，然后我们俩上了同一所大学。

01:02:44.250 --> 01:02:47.849
I came out my sophomore year of college and then we started dating.
我在大学二年级出柜，之后我们开始交往。

01:02:47.849 --> 01:02:52.969
We dated on and off from 2013 to 2017 when we finally got engaged.
从2013年到2017年我们最终订婚，期间分分合合。

01:02:52.969 --> 01:02:56.289
It was a difficult will they or won't they several years.
那是充满纠结、不知能否修成正果的几年。

01:02:56.289 --> 01:03:02.650
We were broken up when I graduated from college and that summer I binge watched how I met your mother for the first time.
我大学毕业时我们分手了，那年夏天我第一次疯狂补看《老爸老妈浪漫史》。

01:03:02.650 --> 01:03:08.650
Ted speech about what love is to Jeanette summed up how I felt about my wife in a way I was never able to put into words.
泰德对珍妮特关于什么是爱的演讲，完美总结了我对妻子的感觉，这是我以前从未能用言语表达出来的。

01:03:08.650 --> 01:03:11.909
I kept my love for my wife even when we weren't in each other's lives.
即使我们不在彼此的生活中，我对妻子的爱也从未改变。

01:03:11.909 --> 01:03:15.989
We finally found the right time with our right person in 2017.
2017年，我们在对的时间遇到了对的人。

01:03:15.989 --> 01:03:20.510
We got married in 2019 and have been ridiculously happy together since then.
我们在2019年结婚，从那以后我们一直幸福得不可思议。

01:03:20.510 --> 01:03:24.349
I did tell her she had to watch how I met your mother before we got married.
我确实告诉过她，在我们结婚前她得把《老爸老妈浪漫史》看完。

01:03:24.349 --> 01:03:27.949
It wasn't her typical type of TV show, but she loved it.
这并不是她平时爱看的电视剧类型，但她非常喜欢。

01:03:27.949 --> 01:03:31.550
She said she understood me a bit better after watching my favorite show.
她说看完我最喜欢的节目后，她更懂我了一点。

01:03:31.550 --> 01:03:34.190
We didn't share our wedding vows with each other beforehand.
我们事先没有向对方透露我们的结婚誓言。

01:03:34.190 --> 01:03:38.090
My vows included Marshall's renewal vows from season 9.
我的誓言里包含了第九季中马修的续签誓言。

01:03:38.090 --> 01:03:42.489
My wife's vows included a promise to always watch how I met your mother with me.
我妻子的誓言里包含了一个承诺，那就是永远陪我一起看《老爸老妈浪漫史》。

01:03:42.489 --> 01:03:47.539
Without planning it, we both included this magical story in our wedding.
在没有计划的情况下，我们俩都在婚礼上融入了这个神奇的故事。

01:03:47.539 --> 01:03:49.539
Chelsea, thank you for that.
切尔西，谢谢你分享这个。

01:03:49.539 --> 01:03:51.039
Yeah, that's beautiful.
是的，太美妙了。

01:03:51.039 --> 01:03:52.039
Thank you.
谢谢你。

01:03:52.039 --> 01:03:53.039
That's lovely.
太动人了。

01:03:53.039 --> 01:03:54.539
I'm so happy the show meant that to you guys.
我很高兴这部剧对你们有这样的意义。

01:03:54.539 --> 01:03:55.539
No.
不。

01:03:55.539 --> 01:03:59.099
I think couples that watch how I met your mother together, together.
我觉得一起看《老爸老妈浪漫史》的情侣们，真的就在一起了。

01:03:59.099 --> 01:04:00.099
That's just a truism.
这简直是个颠扑不破的真理。

